---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import data from '../../data/damodaran-real.json';
---

<Base
  title="Tools"
  description="Interactive calculators and charts built on public data, from long-run market returns to the wind forecast."
>
  <div class="page-head">
    <p class="prompt">ls tools/</p>
    <h1>Tools</h1>
    <p class="page-head__summary">
      Interactive tools on public data. They run in your browser and store
      nothing. The calculators send nothing anywhere; the tailwind finder only
      asks Open-Meteo for the forecast at your road.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="studies">
    <li>
      <a class="tile" href="/tools/withdrawal">
        <span class="tile__kicker">monte carlo · {data.years[0]}–{data.years[data.years.length - 1]}</span>
        <span class="tile__title">How long does the money last?</span>
        <span class="tile__summary">
          A safe-withdrawal-rate calculator: the chance a portfolio survives a
          fixed yearly withdrawal, across 5,000 futures built from real returns.
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="tile" href="/tools/history">
        <span class="tile__kicker">charts · {data.years[0]}–{data.years[data.years.length - 1]}</span>
        <span class="tile__title">A century of returns, after inflation</span>
        <span class="tile__summary">
          Growth of €1, rolling returns and drawdowns for US stocks, bonds and
          cash, all corrected for inflation.
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="tile" href="/tools/huren-of-kopen">
        <span class="tile__kicker">calculator · belgium · in dutch</span>
        <span class="tile__title" lang="nl">Huren of kopen?</span>
        <span class="tile__summary">
          Rent or buy in Belgium: the net worth of a buyer and a renter year by
          year, with each region's registration duties and notary fees.
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="tile" href="/tools/risicoprofiel">
        <span class="tile__kicker">questionnaire · belgium · in dutch</span>
        <span class="tile__title" lang="nl">Risicoprofiel</span>
        <span class="tile__summary">
          How much investment risk you want to take and how much you can
          carry: the Grable &amp; Lytton tolerance scale plus a capacity check.
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="tile" href="/tools/pensioen">
        <span class="tile__kicker">calculator · belgium · in dutch</span>
        <span class="tile__title" lang="nl">Pensioen</span>
        <span class="tile__summary">
          Does the money last? A lifetime projection with the statutory
          pension, second pillar, pension savings and a portfolio, after tax.
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a class="tile" href="/tools/tailwind">
        <span class="tile__kicker">map · wind forecast · next 3 days</span>
        <span class="tile__title">Where's the tailwind?</span>
        <span class="tile__summary">
          Draw a road and see, hour by hour, how much of the forecast wind
          pushes you along it. For picking the day to go after a segment.
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Base>
